flowchart LR
    start([Stage starts]) --> logStart[Create processing log]
    logStart --> store[(TenderProcessingJobs)]
    store --> execute[Execute pipeline stage]
    execute --> check{Stage successful?}
    check -->|Yes| complete[Mark stage completed]
    complete --> next[Start next stage]
    next --> finish([Pipeline complete])
    check -->|No| failed[Save error and mark failed]
    failed --> store
    store --> resume[Retry failed stage]
    resume --> execute
